==History==
2024
*The Goblinstein [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 7/10/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/10/2024)|October 2024 Update]].
*On 17/10/2024, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (17/10/2024)|maintenance break]], decreased the Lightning Link’s duration to 4 seconds (from 5 seconds), its [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] Damage by 36%, and increased its cooldown to 17 seconds (from 15 seconds).
*On 30/10/2024, the [[Version History#Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update (30/10/2024)|Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Goblinstein from Scrap Yard to Silent Sanctuary.
*On 14/11/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/11/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Monster's hitpoints by 6%.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], fixed a bug where Lightning Link would not deal reduced damage to the King Tower.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Doctor's hitpoints by 19%.
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Monster's hitpoints by 8%.
*On 9/4/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Monster's hitpoints by 4%
*On 1/9/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Monster’s hitpoints by 4%.

